@startuml entity-state-machines
' ============================================================
' L2 - 业务实体状态机汇总
' 事实来源：docs/00-CGC平台设计总纲.md §3.2 + docs/01-定稿设计/
'   报名workflow详细设计.md §5.2 / 赞助 §5.2 / 邀请 §5.2 / 教研 §5.2
' ============================================================
title 业务实体状态机汇总（L2）
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F0FDE8
    BorderColor #2E7D32
}

' ---------------- Enrollment ---------------- 
state "Enrollment（报名）" as ENR {
    [*] --> draft : 表单开始(可选暂存)
    draft --> submitted : 提交 enrollment.submitted
    submitted --> confirmed : open/invite_only S7 创建成功
    submitted --> pending : request 策略 进入审批
    pending --> rejected : 审批拒绝(A4)
    pending --> confirmed : 审批通过(A3 扣名额)
    submitted --> cancelled : 截止/超时
    pending --> cancelled : 截止/超时
    confirmed --> cancelled : 用户取消/报名截止
}

' ---------------- Sponsorship ---------------- 
state "Sponsorship（赞助）" as SPS {
    [*] --> pending : 意向提交 persist_sponsorship
    pending --> active : 审批通过 activate_sponsorship\n（权益生效）
    pending --> rejected : 审批拒绝
    active --> ended : Event 结束/终止/续期结束
}

' ---------------- SpeakerInvitation ---------------- 
state "SpeakerInvitation（演讲邀请）" as SPI {
    [*] --> invited : Owner 创建 create_invitation
    invited --> accepted : 接受 accept_invitation\ntoken 失效
    invited --> declined : 婉拒 decline_invitation
    invited --> expired : 过期未决策(可选)
    accepted --> completed : 材料产出完成 complete_speaking
}

' ---------------- WorkflowDefinition ---------------- 
state "WorkflowDefinition（流程定义）" as WFD {
    [*] --> draft : 创建
    draft --> published : 发布（可实例化 run）
    published --> archived : 归档（改定义不影响已开始 run）
}

' ---------------- InviteBatch ---------------- 
state "InviteBatch（邀请批次）" as IVB {
    [*] --> active : 后台创建
    active --> disabled : 停用（S6 校验失败）
    active --> exhausted : 配额用尽 remaining_quota=0\n（或到有效期）
}

' ---------------- ResearchOutput ---------------- 
state "ResearchOutput（教研产出）" as RSO {
    [*] --> drafted : save_outline / save_materials
    drafted --> ready : 物料保存完成\n（审核通过/免审核）
    ready --> archived : 归档 archive_materials
}

note bottom of ENR
  **与 WorkflowRun 状态对应**：
  - draft/submitted → run pending/running（S1 waiting）
  - pending → run waiting（报名段停住，等审批段）
  - confirmed → run succeeded（A3/A5 后）
  - rejected/cancelled → run failed/cancelled（终态）
  v1 主路径：submitted → confirmed（open 策略），run succeeded。
end note

note bottom of SPS
  **v1 主路径**：pending → active（审批通过），run succeeded。
  收款/支付 = 二期：状态机需插 payment_pending → paid（在 active 前）。
end note

@enduml
